<title>USA: U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimate Thursday's hog slaughter from 348,000 to 352,000 head versus 359,000 a week ago and 359,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Cattle slaughter estimates ranged from 123,000 to 133,000 head against 127,000 a week ago and 132,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720</p>
</text>
